.git
bin
docs
*.md
.env
# Keep the build context to ONLY what the Go build + the chart's wait-script need.
# Exclude the secret-bearing values overlays, the seed scripts, tasks, and tests so the build
# context (and pushed image) never carries credentials or non-build repo content.
tasks
test
deploy/values-*.yaml
deploy/*-values.yaml
# Of deploy/seed only the Go package and the four documents it embeds (seed.go) are build input.
deploy/seed/*
!deploy/seed/seed.go
!deploy/seed/flavors.json
!deploy/seed/price-plan-seed.json
!deploy/seed/platform-configuration.json
!deploy/seed/billing-configuration.json
**/*_test.go
web
